<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mellon Bank lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mellon Bank lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston said Tuesday it lowered its rating on Mellon Bank Corp to hold from buy.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Mellon's shares were off 1/8 at 44-3/4.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
